1. Open your app in the Dropbox App Console.
2. Click the Permissions tab.
3. Tick these three permissions:
files.content.write.
files.content.read
files.metadata.read
4. Scroll down and click Submit to save the permissions. 
Step 2 — Generate the access token
1. Open the Settings tab.
2. Find the OAuth 2 section.
3. Locate Generated access token and click Generate.

